spoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]]\n*2 Tbsp chopped [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]]\n*1 Tbsp chopped fresh [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n*1 Tbsp chopped [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n*2 Tbsp chopped [[Cookbook:Green Onion|green onions]]\n*1 Tbsp reduced sodium [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n*1 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Fish Stock (Fumet de poisson)|fish stock]]\n*1 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n==Procedure==\n#Add oil to [[Cookbook:Wok|wok]] or [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|frying pan]] over medium-high heat.\n#Add halibut cheeks, moving around in oil until they start to brown.\n#Add carrots and celery, stirring them around in the wok.\n#Add ginger and garlic, while continuing to stir.\n#Add soy sauce and fish stock. Stir and bring to [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]].\n#[[Cookbook:Garnish|Garnish]] with green onions.\n#Serve and enjoy.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* Use any assortment of vegetables you like (frozen works fine).\n* Serve with rice. Garnish with fresh [[Cookbook:Cilantro|cilantro]], [[Cookbook:Green Onion|scallions]], and or shredded [[Cookbook:Cabbage|red cabbage]].\n* Add [[Cookbook:Red pepper flakes|red pepper flakes]] for added heat.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using halibut]]\n[[Category:Stir fry recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peanut oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Halibut Cheek Stir-Fry","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"5","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 Tbsp peanut oil","sourceText":"1 Tbsp peanut oil","amountText":"1 Tbsp peanut oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 lb (450 g) halibut cheeks","sourceText":"1 lb (450 g) halibut cheeks","amountText":"1 lb (450 g) 